From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:44:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 268/333] [ae-patch] Queue Compact for a safe point and have
 the chat save its notes first

Compact no longer fires on the spot, and it works while the chat is running. Two
clicks queue it for the open chat. When the chat is idle and quiet (no turn, no
background shell, nothing waiting on the user or queued ahead) for two seconds, it
gets one normal turn asking it to save what is worth keeping to memory or a
handoff note; when that turn ends, the compact event goes out. The button shows
Cancel while queued or saving, a failed step compacts nothing and says why, and
leaving the chat drops the plan. The plan lives in the page, so a reload forgets it.
